## 2. Nuxt.js (Vue Framework)

### Mục tiêu

Nuxt.js là full-stack framework được xây trên Vue.js, cung cấp Server-Side Rendering (SSR), Static Site Generation (SSG), và nhiều features khác giúp đơn giản hóa việc xây dựng các Vue applications. Nuxt.js là lựa chọn lý tưởng cho các projects cần SEO tốt, performance cao, và unified developer experience.

### Nguyên tắc

**1. Nuxt 3 First**

Use Nuxt 3 for all new projects. Vue 3 + Vite based. Better performance and TypeScript support.

**2. Auto-Imports**

Components, composables, và utils được auto-imported. Don't manually import common items. Reduce boilerplate significantly.

**3. File-Based Routing**

Routes được tự động tạo từ file structure. layouts/, pages/, middleware/. Dynamic routes với [id].ext.

**4. Server Routes**

Implement API endpoints in server/ directory. H3 (unjs/h3) under the hood. Type-safe request handling.

**5. Data Fetching Composables**

useFetch cho SSR-friendly fetching. useAsyncData cho cached requests. $fetch cho client-side only.

**6. State Management**

useState for SSR-safe shared state. Pinia integration available.

**7. Rendering Modes**

SSG cho marketing sites. SSR cho dynamic content. SPA mode cho pure client apps. Hybrid rendering với route rules.

### Checklist

- [ ] Nuxt 3 project initialized
- [ ] TypeScript configured
- [ ] Rendering mode selected
- [ ] Nuxt modules installed
- [ ] Server routes organized
- [ ] Data fetching patterns established
- [ ] State management configured
- [ ] Error handling implemented
- [ ] SEO metadata configured
- [ ] Testing setup complete

### Anti Pattern

**1. Manual Imports When Auto-Import Works** - Adds unnecessary boilerplate.

**2. Blocking Async Data** - Not awaiting async data causes SSR hydration mismatches.

**3. Mixing Client và Server State** - Not understanding where state lives causes hydration issues.

**4. Heavy Client-Side Rendering** - Overusing client-only components impacts SEO.

### Best Practice

```typescript
// nuxt.config.ts
export default defineNuxtConfig({
  modules: [
    '@nuxtjs/tailwindcss',
    '@pinia/nuxt',
    '@vueuse/nuxt',
    '@nuxt/image'
  ],
  
  routeRules: {
    '/': { prerender: true },
    '/blog/**': { swr: 3600 },
    '/dashboard/**': { ssr: true },
    '/admin/**': { ssr: false }
  }
});
```

```typescript
// Data Fetching
const { data: post } = await useAsyncData(
  `post-${route.params.slug}`,
  () => $fetch<BlogPost>(`/api/blog/${route.params.slug}`)
);

useSeoMeta({
  title: () => post.value?.title,
  description: () => post.value?.excerpt
});
```

