## Framework Selection Guide

| Use Case | Recommended Framework |
|----------|----------------------|
| SEO-focused marketing site | Next.js (SSG) hoặc Nuxt (SSG) |
| Complex dashboard | Next.js hoặc Vue + Nuxt |
| Simple SPA | Vue.js trực tiếp |
| Full-stack with API | Nuxt (server routes) hoặc Next.js (API routes) |
| Team familiar with React | Next.js |
| Team familiar with Vue | Nuxt.js |
| Quick prototyping | Vue.js (Vite) |

