## Skill Integration for Frontend Development

### Frontend Taste Skill

Cho landing pages, portfolios, marketing sites, và greenfield builds. Include:
- **Pre-Review Gate:** Brief inference, design read declaration, dial setting (VARIANCE/MOTION/DENSITY)
- **3 Dials System:** DESIGN_VARIANCE, MOTION_INTENSITY, VISUAL_DENSITY (1-10)
- **Post-Review Gate:** 60+ checklist items across correctness, design, a11y, performance

### Frontend Redesign Skill

Cho việc upgrade website/app hiện có:
- **Design Audit:** 50+ checklist items across typography, color, layout, interactivity
- **Fix Priority:** Font swap > Color cleanup > Hover states > Layout > Generic components

### Full Output Skill

- **Pre-Generation Scope Lock:** Count deliverables, lock the list
- **Banned Patterns:** `// TODO`, skeleton when full impl requested, "continue later"

### Frontend Review Skill

Mandatory dual-gate review cho mọi frontend task:
- **Pre-Review Gate:** Scope analysis, quality plan, checklist
- **Post-Review Gate:** 60+ items across correctness, design, accessibility, performance

